### 📄 Get all workcells
GET http://localhost:5000/api/workcells
Accept: application/json

###

### 📄 Get active workcells only
GET http://localhost:5000/api/workcells?isActive=true
Accept: application/json

###

### 🔍 Search workcell
GET http://localhost:5000/api/workcells?search=ADVANTEST
Accept: application/json

###

### 🔍 Get workcell by id
GET http://localhost:5000/api/workcells/1
Accept: application/json

###

### ❌ Invalid id
GET http://localhost:5000/api/workcells/abc
Accept: application/json
